('293', '17', 'process_steps', '7'),
('294', '17', '_process_steps', 'field_svc_process'),
('295', '17', 'service_faq', 'a:12:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:38:"How much does a website cost in Dubai?";s:6:"answer";s:456:"Website costs in Dubai range from AED 5,000–15,000 for a small business site (5–10 pages, WordPress theme with customisation) to AED 30,000–80,000+ for a fully bespoke enterprise website with complex functionality, custom design, and a large page count. The price reflects the scope: pages, custom functionality, design complexity, content creation, and CMS configuration. We provide detailed proposals after understanding your specific requirements.";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:41:"How long does it take to build a website?";s:6:"answer";s:509:"A well-structured web design project takes 8–16 weeks from kick-off to launch, depending on scope. Smaller brochure sites (5–10 pages) can be completed in 6–8 weeks with prompt client feedback. Larger sites with complex functionality or large page counts typically take 12–20 weeks. The most common cause of project delays is content — ensuring your text, images, and other materials are ready before development begins is the single most important thing clients can do to keep projects on schedule.";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:32:"Do you build WordPress websites?";s:6:"answer";s:436:"Yes — WordPress is our primary platform for client websites, and we\'re specialists in it. WordPress powers over 43% of all websites and offers unmatched flexibility, a vast plugin ecosystem, and complete content control for non-technical users. We build bespoke WordPress themes (not page-builder templates) for clients who need design uniqueness, and we also work with page builders (Elementor, Divi) where appropriate for the scope.";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:34:"Do you design e-commerce websites?";s:6:"answer";s:374:"Yes. We design and build e-commerce websites on WooCommerce (WordPress), Shopify, and custom platforms. E-commerce design requires specialist knowledge of product page optimisation, checkout flow friction reduction, trust signal placement, and technical SEO for catalogue pages. Our e-commerce projects always include conversion rate optimisation as a core design principle.";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:35:"Will my new website rank on Google?";s:6:"answer";s:501:"A professionally designed website with proper technical SEO foundations will significantly outperform a poorly built one in search — but ranking requires ongoing SEO investment beyond just good website design. What we guarantee: your site will be technically sound, fast, mobile-friendly, properly structured with schema markup, and well-organised for search engines to understand. Whether you combine the launch with an ongoing SEO campaign determines how quickly you achieve the rankings you want.";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:52:"Do you design in Arabic/RTL (right-to-left) layouts?";s:6:"answer";s:387:"Yes. We design full RTL (right-to-left) Arabic versions of websites for clients targeting Emirati and Arab audiences. This is more complex than translation — it requires genuinely designing for RTL text flow, mirrored navigation, appropriate Arabic typography, and culturally relevant visual choices. We have native Arabic speakers and designers with RTL design experience on our team.";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:62:"What is Core Web Vitals and why does it matter for my website?";s:6:"answer";s:453:"Core Web Vitals are Google\'s page experience metrics: LCP (how fast your main content loads), INP (how quickly your page responds to interaction), and CLS (how stable your layout is while loading). Google uses these as ranking signals. Poor Core Web Vitals scores mean ranking lower than competitors with better-performing sites, even with equivalent content and links. All websites we build are optimised for Core Web Vitals from the development phase.";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:53:"Do you provide content writing services for websites?";s:6:"answer";s:466:"Yes. We offer copywriting as an add-on to web design projects. Our UAE-based copywriters create SEO-optimised, conversion-focused content for all key pages: homepage, about, services, contact, and blog. Content written specifically for your site by professionals who understand both SEO requirements and sales psychology consistently outperforms placeholder or self-written content. We recommend investing in professional copy for at least the core commercial pages.";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:38:"Can you redesign our existing website?";s:6:"answer";s:435:"Yes — redesigns make up a significant portion of our web design work. We begin redesign projects with a full audit of the existing site: analytics review (what\'s working, what\'s not), SEO audit (to preserve existing rankings), competitive analysis, and user feedback. We then redesign with the goal of retaining what\'s working, fixing what isn\'t, and achieving measurably better performance on conversion rate and organic visibility.";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:34:"How do you handle website hosting?";s:6:"answer";s:436:"We recommend and configure hosting for all client websites, but you retain full ownership of your hosting account. We typically recommend UAE-based or GCC-CDN-enabled hosting for the best local page speeds, recommend managed WordPress hosting (WP Engine, Kinsta, or Cloudways) for performance and security, and configure Cloudflare CDN to optimise delivery globally. We can also work with your existing hosting provider if you have one.";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:49:"What ongoing support do you provide after launch?";s:6:"answer";s:445:"All clients receive a post-launch support period (typically 30 days) covering bug fixes and minor adjustments at no additional cost. Beyond this, we offer ongoing maintenance plans covering security updates, plugin/theme updates, regular backups, uptime monitoring, and monthly performance checks. We also offer a retainer arrangement for clients who want ongoing design and development support for new landing pages, features, and improvements.";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:37:"Do you provide websites for startups?";s:6:"answer";s:408:"Yes. We work with businesses at every stage — from early-stage startups launching their first online presence to established enterprises redesigning their flagship sites. For startups with budget constraints, we\'ll be honest about what\'s achievable at different investment levels and recommend the right scope for your stage. A great startup website doesn\'t have to be expensive — it has to be strategic.";}}'),
