('787', '14', 'process_steps_0_step_title', 'AI Search Landscape Analysis'),
('788', '14', '_process_steps_0_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('789', '14', 'process_steps_0_step_desc', 'We audit which AI search platforms are generating traffic in your industry, which competitor content is being cited, and what content characteristics the AI systems are rewarding — giving us a precise target to optimise towards.'),
('790', '14', '_process_steps_0_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('791', '14', 'process_steps_1_step_title', 'Entity & Knowledge Graph Audit'),
('792', '14', '_process_steps_1_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('793', '14', 'process_steps_1_step_desc', 'We assess your brand\'s entity presence across the web — Google Knowledge Panel, Wikidata, LinkedIn, major publications — and identify the gaps preventing AI systems from recognising your authority.'),
('794', '14', '_process_steps_1_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('795', '14', 'process_steps_2_step_title', 'Content Architecture Redesign'),
('796', '14', '_process_steps_2_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('797', '14', 'process_steps_2_step_desc', 'We restructure your key pages with AI-friendly content formats: clear definitions, numbered lists, comparison tables, FAQ sections, and expert author signals that AI systems preferentially extract and cite.'),
('798', '14', '_process_steps_2_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('799', '14', 'process_steps_3_step_title', 'Schema & Structured Data'),
('800', '14', '_process_steps_3_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('801', '14', 'process_steps_3_step_desc', 'Comprehensive schema markup implementation (FAQPage, HowTo, Article, Person, Organization, Service, LocalBusiness) makes your content machine-readable for AI systems and earns rich results in traditional search.'),
('802', '14', '_process_steps_3_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('803', '14', 'process_steps_4_step_title', 'Authority Signal Building'),
('804', '14', '_process_steps_4_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('805', '14', 'process_steps_4_step_desc', 'Digital PR campaigns, expert commentary placements, podcast appearances, and authoritative publication features build the external citation network that AI models use to assess your expertise and trustworthiness.'),
('806', '14', '_process_steps_4_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('807', '14', 'process_steps_5_step_title', 'Conversational Content Creation'),
('808', '14', '_process_steps_5_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('809', '14', 'process_steps_5_step_desc', 'We create content optimised for conversational, natural language queries — the query style predominantly used with AI assistants. This includes comprehensive FAQ content, how-to guides, and comparison content.'),
('810', '14', '_process_steps_5_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('811', '14', 'process_steps_6_step_title', 'Monitor & Adapt'),
('812', '14', '_process_steps_6_step_title', 'field_proc_title'),
('813', '14', 'process_steps_6_step_desc', 'Monthly tracking of AI Overview appearances, competitor citation rates, and brand mention velocity across AI platforms. We continuously adapt strategy as AI search algorithms evolve rapidly.'),
('814', '14', '_process_steps_6_step_desc', 'field_proc_desc'),
('815', '14', 'service_faqs_0_question', 'What is Google AI Overviews and how do I appear in them?'),
('816', '14', '_service_faqs_0_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('817', '14', 'service_faqs_0_answer', '<p>Google AI Overviews are AI-generated summaries appearing at the top of Google results, synthesising information from multiple web sources. To appear, your content needs to be comprehensive, well-structured, and trusted by Google as an authoritative source. Key factors: strong E-E-A-T signals, FAQPage/HowTo schema markup, existing first-page rankings for the target query, and a well-established brand entity in Google\'s Knowledge Graph.</p>'),
('818', '14', '_service_faqs_0_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('819', '14', 'service_faqs_1_question', 'What is GEO (Generative Engine Optimisation)?'),
('820', '14', '_service_faqs_1_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('821', '14', 'service_faqs_1_answer', '<p>GEO is the discipline of optimising your digital presence to be cited and recommended by AI search engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, and Google Gemini. Unlike traditional SEO which focuses on ranking in blue-link results, GEO focuses on building the authority, trust signals, and content characteristics that cause AI models to cite your business when users ask relevant questions.</p>'),
('822', '14', '_service_faqs_1_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('823', '14', 'service_faqs_2_question', 'Does AI search reduce the value of traditional SEO?'),
('824', '14', '_service_faqs_2_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('825', '14', 'service_faqs_2_answer', '<p>AI search complements rather than replaces traditional SEO — approximately 70% of AI Overview citations come from pages already ranking in the top 10 organic results. However, AI search reduces click-through rates for queries where AIOs provide complete answers. The smart strategy: maintain strong <a href="/services/search-engine-optimization">SEO foundations</a> while simultaneously optimising for AI citation.</p>'),
('826', '14', '_service_faqs_2_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('827', '14', 'service_faqs_3_question', 'Which AI platforms should I optimise for?'),
('828', '14', '_service_faqs_3_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('829', '14', 'service_faqs_3_answer', '<p>Priority platforms for UAE businesses: Google AI Overviews (highest traffic volume), Perplexity AI (fastest growing, influential in B2B research), ChatGPT with Browse/Search (enormous user base), Bing Copilot (integrated into Microsoft 365), and Google Gemini. Optimising for one tends to improve visibility across all, since all AI systems value the same things — comprehensive content, verified expertise, and strong brand authority.</p>'),
('830', '14', '_service_faqs_3_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('831', '14', 'service_faqs_4_question', 'What is entity SEO and why does it matter for AI search?'),
('832', '14', '_service_faqs_4_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('833', '14', 'service_faqs_4_answer', '<p>Entities are the real-world people, organisations, places, and concepts that knowledge graphs like Google\'s track and connect. AI systems rely heavily on entity relationships when researching topics. Entity SEO builds your brand\'s presence across structured data sources, Knowledge Graph entries, Wikidata, LinkedIn, major directories, and citation networks. Strong entity presence is increasingly critical to AI visibility.</p>'),
('834', '14', '_service_faqs_4_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('835', '14', 'service_faqs_5_question', 'How do you measure success in AI search optimisation?'),
('836', '14', '_service_faqs_5_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('837', '14', 'service_faqs_5_answer', '<p>We track: frequency of Google AIO appearances for target queries, brand mention velocity on AI platforms, Knowledge Panel presence and completeness, featured snippet ownership rates, Share of Voice in AI-generated responses versus competitors, and referral traffic from AI platforms like Perplexity. We use specialised monitoring tools plus manual query sampling to build a picture of your AI search visibility over time.</p>'),
('838', '14', '_service_faqs_5_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('839', '14', 'service_faqs_6_question', 'Do I need separate Arabic content for AI search for UAE audiences?'),
('840', '14', '_service_faqs_6_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('841', '14', 'service_faqs_6_answer', '<p>Yes. Arabic-language AI queries require Arabic-language authoritative content to be cited. UAE consumers increasingly use voice search and AI assistants in Arabic, particularly for local service queries. We create bilingual AI-optimised content — English and Arabic — with proper hreflang implementation and outreach to Arabic-language authoritative publications.</p>'),
('842', '14', '_service_faqs_6_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('843', '14', 'service_faqs_7_question', 'How is AI SEO different from traditional SEO?'),
('844', '14', '_service_faqs_7_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('845', '14', 'service_faqs_7_answer', '<p>Traditional SEO optimises for algorithmic ranking signals — backlinks, keywords, technical factors. AI SEO optimises for trustworthiness and citation-worthiness — comprehensiveness, factual accuracy, expert authorship, brand authority, and structured data. AI systems prefer definitional content, structured answers, numbered processes, and FAQ formats that can be cleanly extracted and synthesised.</p>'),
('846', '14', '_service_faqs_7_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('847', '14', 'service_faqs_8_question', 'What is schema markup and how does it help AI search?'),
('848', '14', '_service_faqs_8_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('849', '14', 'service_faqs_8_answer', '<p>Schema markup is structured data (JSON-LD) added to your HTML that explicitly describes your content to search engines and AI systems. FAQPage schema tells Google your content contains Q&A pairs ideal for AIO sourcing. HowTo schema marks up step-by-step processes. Organization and LocalBusiness schemas verify your brand identity and Dubai location. AI systems consume schema markup directly.</p>'),
('850', '14', '_service_faqs_8_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
('851', '14', 'service_faqs_9_question', 'How quickly can AI SEO show results?'),
('852', '14', '_service_faqs_9_question', 'field_faq_q'),
('853', '14', 'service_faqs_9_answer', '<p>Some quick wins — appearing in featured snippets or implementing FAQPage schema — can produce visible results within 4–8 weeks. Building comprehensive entity authority and consistent AIO appearances is a 3–6 month process. The competitive advantage is significant: most UAE businesses have not yet begun optimising for AI search, meaning early movers can establish dominant AI visibility before the market catches up. <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> to assess your current AI search visibility.</p>'),
('854', '14', '_service_faqs_9_answer', 'field_faq_a'),
