('1475', '195', 'location_faqs', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:61:"Can SEO help a dive centre near Snoopy Island rank on Google?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:309:"Absolutely. "Diving Dibba", "snorkelling Snoopy Island", and "dive centre East Coast UAE" are high-intent searches with strong booking conversion rates. We optimise dive businesses for the full range of experience and destination queries, combined with GBP management to capture nearby searchers in real time.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:54:"Is Dibba Al Fujairah a good market for SEO investment?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:277:"Excellent. Dibba has low SEO competition relative to the quality of its tourism product. Businesses that invest in SEO now can establish durable first-page rankings before the market matures. The ROI timeline is typically faster than equivalent campaigns in Dubai or Abu Dhabi.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:75:"Do you help hotels and resorts in Dibba rank for UAE weekend-trip searches?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:315:"Yes. A major traffic opportunity for Dibba accommodation is the "UAE weekend getaway" audience — people in Dubai and Abu Dhabi searching for short breaks. We target this audience with destination content that ranks for "East Coast UAE hotel", "Fujairah weekend trip", and similar queries, driving direct bookings.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:60:"Can you help a restaurant in Dibba get found on Google Maps?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:297:"Yes. Google Maps is critical in Dibba because visitors and travellers frequently search for food options while exploring the area. We fully optimise your GBP listing with accurate location, categories, photos, menu information, and Arabic and English descriptions to maximise your Maps visibility.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:60:"How does Dibba Al Fujairah SEO compare to Fujairah city SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:374:"Dibba and Fujairah city serve different audiences. Fujairah city has higher resident search volume and more commercial service competition. Dibba has more tourism-driven search intent and lower competition. Our strategy for Dibba focuses more on destination content and experience-driven queries, while Fujairah city campaigns prioritise local service and business searches.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:45:"Do you offer Arabic SEO for Dibba businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:258:"Yes. A significant share of Dibba\'s local population and its regional tourism audience searches in Arabic. We provide bilingual Arabic–English SEO across all Dibba campaigns, ensuring your business captures the full breadth of search demand in this market.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:61:"What is the typical SEO budget for a small business in Dibba?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:326:"Our Dibba SEO packages start from AED 2,500 per month for focused GBP and local SEO. Tourism businesses with more competitive targets typically invest AED 3,500–6,000 per month to build the content and authority assets needed to rank for high-volume destination searches. We provide a tailored proposal after the free audit.";}}'),
