('1491', '197', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:51:"How long does SEO take for a Dubai Marina business?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:319:"Most Marina clients see meaningful keyword improvements within 60–90 days and strong organic traffic growth by month three to four. Competitive niches like restaurants or real estate may take slightly longer, but we start generating quick wins (GBP improvements, technical fixes, citation gains) in the first 30 days.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:62:"Do you optimise Google Business Profile for Marina businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:248:"Yes. Google Business Profile optimisation is a core part of every Marina SEO campaign. We optimise your listing name, categories, service areas, description, photos, and posts, then implement a review acquisition strategy to build your star rating.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:39:"Can you do SEO for a Marina restaurant?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:274:"Absolutely. We have worked with multiple Marina F&B businesses, optimising them for searches like "best restaurant Dubai Marina", "rooftop bar marina", and cuisine-specific queries. We combine GBP optimisation, local link building, and on-page content to drive reservations.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:48:"Do you provide Arabic SEO for Marina businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:225:"Yes. Dubai Marina has a significant Arabic-speaking resident and visitor population. We provide full Arabic keyword research and bilingual on-page optimisation to capture both Arabic and English search demand in the district.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:37:"What does a Marina SEO audit include?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:241:"Our free Marina SEO audit covers: keyword gap analysis for Marina-specific terms, technical site crawl, GBP review, competitor benchmark, and backlink profile review. You receive a prioritised action plan with estimated impact for each item.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:51:"How do you build local links for Marina businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:250:"We earn links from Dubai business directories, hospitality and lifestyle publications, local event coverage, and relevant industry associations. Every link is relevant, white-hat, and geographically targeted to reinforce your Marina authority signal.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:57:"Do you offer monthly SEO retainers for Marina businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:228:"Yes. We offer flexible monthly SEO retainers tailored to Marina business budgets, from focused GBP and local SEO packages to full-scale organic growth campaigns. Contact us for a custom proposal based on your industry and goals.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:36:"How do you track ROI for Marina SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:266:"We track keyword rankings, organic traffic, click-through rates, goal completions (form fills, call clicks, bookings), and where available, phone call volume. Monthly reports connect SEO activity to real business outcomes so you can see return on every dirham spent.";}}'),
