('1507', '199', 'location_faqs', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:48:"Is Arabic SEO important for businesses in Deira?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:298:"Extremely important. Deira has one of the highest Arabic search-volume concentrations in Dubai. A significant portion of searches for gold, wholesale goods, money exchanges, and local services in Deira are conducted in Arabic. Businesses optimised only in English miss a large share of this demand.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:48:"How can a Deira gold shop rank higher on Google?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:344:"We optimise gold retailers for both transactional queries ("gold jewellery Deira price", "22k gold ring Dubai") and informational queries ("gold souk opening hours", "best gold rate Dubai"). Combining GBP optimisation, schema markup, bilingual on-page content, and review building typically produces visible ranking improvements within 60 days.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:67:"Can SEO help a wholesale business in Deira attract regional buyers?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:297:"Yes. Many regional B2B buyers in the Middle East and South Asia use Google to find suppliers. We optimise wholesale businesses for supplier-intent keywords, build content that speaks to buyer pain points, and implement structured data that helps Google surface your products to the right audience.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:60:"Do you manage Google Business Profiles for Deira businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:277:"Yes. GBP management is a core service for Deira businesses given the high volume of "near me" and district-specific searches from mobile users in the area. We fully optimise your listing, manage photos and posts, respond to reviews, and implement a review acquisition strategy.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:45:"How long does Deira SEO take to show results?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:302:"GBP improvements and local pack visibility gains typically show within 30–45 days. Organic website ranking improvements for competitive terms take 3–5 months of consistent work. The timeline depends on your current baseline, industry competition, and the pace of content and link-building activity.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:53:"Can you help a Deira hotel rank for tourist searches?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:313:"Yes. We optimise hotels and guesthouses for tourist-intent queries — "budget hotel near Gold Souk", "hotel Deira city centre view", "Deira hotel Ramadan deals" — combining on-page optimisation, schema markup, OTA page analysis, and GBP management to capture both direct booking searches and discovery queries.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:56:"Do you offer SEO for money exchange businesses in Deira?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:287:"Yes. Money exchange is a highly regulated and locally competitive search vertical. We help exchange houses optimise for rate-comparison and location queries while ensuring all content meets regulatory content standards. Compliance-aware SEO is a core part of our service for this sector.";}}'),
