('1515', '200', 'location_faqs', 'a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:66:"Can SEO help a restaurant near Burj Khalifa rank higher on Google?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:338:"Yes. "Best restaurant near Burj Khalifa", "dinner with Burj Khalifa view", and similar landmark-adjacent queries generate thousands of monthly searches with strong booking intent. We optimise your website and Google Business Profile specifically for these searches, combining on-page content, structured data, and local citation building.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:59:"How does SEO work for a Downtown Dubai luxury retail brand?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:306:"For luxury retail we combine product and category page optimisation for high-intent shopping searches, editorial content targeting lifestyle and gifting queries, and local SEO for in-store visit traffic. We also optimise for "near me" and district-specific searches that Google surfaces to nearby shoppers.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:55:"Is Downtown Dubai SEO different from general Dubai SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:294:"Yes. Downtown has a unique blend of tourist intent (landmark searches, "best of" queries, experience-driven searches) and resident intent (daily services, professional needs). A Downtown-specific strategy maps your business against both audiences rather than targeting generic city-level terms.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:67:"Do you optimise Google Maps listings for Downtown Dubai businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:280:"Absolutely. Google Maps and the local 3-pack are especially important in Downtown because of the high volume of tourists using Google Maps to discover nearby venues in real time. We fully optimise your GBP listing with categories, attributes, photos, posts, and review management.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:63:"How quickly can a Downtown Dubai business see results from SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:287:"Quick wins — improved GBP rankings, better visibility for long-tail queries — typically appear within 30–60 days. Sustained first-page rankings for competitive terms like "best restaurant Downtown Dubai" usually take 3–5 months of consistent optimisation and content development.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:86:"Can you help a short-term rental or vacation-home business in Downtown rank on Google?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:286:"Yes. Short-term rental and holiday home businesses benefit enormously from SEO because direct bookings through organic search eliminate commission fees. We optimise for property-specific and neighbourhood searches and help you compete with Airbnb and Booking.com for organic visibility.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:60:"Do you offer multilingual SEO for Downtown Dubai businesses?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:254:"Yes. Downtown attracts visitors and residents from across the world. We offer bilingual Arabic–English SEO as standard and can incorporate additional language targeting (Chinese, Russian, French) for businesses with significant international audiences.";}}'),
