('1523', '201', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:48:"Does SEO work for B2B SaaS companies in the UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:261:"Yes — and it is often the highest-ROI acquisition channel. B2B buyers in the UAE conduct intensive online research before vendor contact. Ranking for the right keywords puts you in front of decision-makers at the moment they are actively evaluating solutions.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:73:"Can you rank a UAE SaaS company against global platforms like Salesforce?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:209:"Yes — by targeting UAE-specific and niche keyword segments where global platforms have less content depth or localisation. We build a topic cluster strategy around your specific use cases and buyer segments.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:28:"How long does SaaS SEO take?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:198:"Informational and long-tail B2B terms rank in 2–3 months. Competitive category terms take 6–9 months. The compounding nature of SaaS SEO makes it extremely valuable over a 12–24 month horizon.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:45:"Do you create technical content for SaaS SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:144:"Yes. Our B2B content team includes writers with technology backgrounds who produce accurate, insightful content for complex software categories.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:53:"Can you help a UAE SaaS company rank internationally?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:118:"Yes. We build international SEO strategies for UAE SaaS companies targeting GCC, MENA, South Asia, and global markets.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:43:"What metrics do you track for SaaS B2B SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:173:"We track organic sessions, leads (demo requests, free trial signups, contact form submissions), MQLs attributed to organic, and pipeline value — not just keyword rankings.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:53:"Do you work with DIFC and TECOM technology companies?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:129:"Yes. We serve technology companies based in DIFC, TECOM, Dubai Internet City, Dubai Silicon Oasis, and free zones across the UAE.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:61:"How do you approach SaaS keyword research for the UAE market?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:176:"We map keywords across all buyer journey stages: category awareness, comparison, feature-specific, and conversion. Each stage requires different content and ranking strategies.";}}'),
