('1529', '202', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:62:"How does SEO increase student enrolment for a UAE institution?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:259:"By ranking for the specific programme and institution comparison searches students conduct during their research phase. We ensure your institution appears at every stage of the enrolment journey — from initial programme discovery through application intent.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:60:"Can a private school in Dubai rank above government schools?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:222:"Yes. Private schools often have faster, more flexible websites and can invest in SEO more rapidly than government institutions. We have ranked private Dubai schools above government competitors for key parent search terms.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:54:"Do you work with professional certification providers?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:182:"Yes. Professional training and certification SEO is a specialism — we target career development, professional qualification, and upskilling searches from UAE working professionals.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:53:"Can you rank an online education platform in the UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:167:"Yes. Edtech and online learning SEO is a growing specialism, targeting both local UAE learners and international students accessing UAE-accredited programmes remotely.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:34:"Do you offer Arabic education SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:104:"Yes — bilingual education SEO including full Arabic keyword mapping and content creation is available.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:33:"How long does education SEO take?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:154:"Programme and institutional ranking keywords typically take 3–5 months to reach page 1. Brand and comparison terms can rank faster, within 60–90 days.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:62:"How do you handle parent vs student search intent differently?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:231:"Parents search for schools with safety, curriculum, and accreditation intent. Students search for programmes with career outcome, ranking, and cost intent. We create content and landing pages that address both audiences distinctly.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:29:"What does education SEO cost?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:117:"Education SEO packages start from AED 2,500/month. Contact us for a free competitor audit and enrolment SEO strategy.";}}'),
