('1535', '203', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:62:"Can a UAE used car dealer rank against Dubizzle and CarSwitch?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:148:"Yes — by targeting transactional buyer keywords, specific make/model searches, and trust-building content that classified platforms don\'t provide.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:64:"Do you offer SEO for car service centres and garages in the UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:180:"Yes. Automotive service SEO is one of the strongest local SEO applications — targeting "car service near me Dubai", "[make] specialist garage UAE", and emergency repair searches.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:63:"Can you help a UAE car rental company rank for rental keywords?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:178:"Yes. Car rental SEO is a highly competitive and high-value segment. We build a keyword strategy covering leisure, corporate, long-term, and specific vehicle type rental searches.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:65:"How do you rank a Dubai car showroom for luxury vehicle searches?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:148:"Through brand-specific landing pages, model comparison content, test drive offer pages, and Google Maps optimisation for showroom location searches.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:60:"Do you work with automotive parts and accessories retailers?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:150:"Yes. E-commerce automotive SEO for parts and accessories is a specialism, including product category optimisation and fitment-based keyword targeting.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:34:"How long does automotive SEO take?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:116:"Local service and repair keywords rank in 45–75 days. Competitive "buy car" and dealer searches take 4–6 months.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:40:"Do you provide bilingual automotive SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:157:"Yes — Arabic language automotive content is standard. UAE car buyers conduct searches in both Arabic and English at different stages of the buying journey.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:46:"What is the cost of automotive SEO in the UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:109:"Automotive SEO packages start from AED 2,800/month. Contact us for a free site audit and competitor analysis.";}}'),
