('1538', '84', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:32:"How much does SEO cost in Dubai?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:163:"SEO in Dubai typically ranges from AED 3,000–25,000/month depending on competition, website size, and target keywords. Request a free audit for a tailored quote.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:50:"How long does it take to see SEO results in Dubai?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:127:"Most Dubai businesses see measurable ranking improvements within 60–90 days. Full campaign momentum arrives at 9–12 months.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:33:"Do you offer Arabic SEO in Dubai?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:126:"Yes. Our Dubai SEO services include full Arabic keyword research, Arabic content creation, and bilingual on-page optimisation.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:46:"Do you guarantee first page rankings in Dubai?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:156:"No ethical SEO agency can guarantee specific rankings. However, over 85% of our Dubai clients reach page 1 for their primary target keywords within 90 days.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:51:"Can you help my Dubai business rank in Google Maps?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:155:"Yes. Our local SEO service includes full Google Business Profile optimisation, review management, local citation building, and LocalBusiness schema markup.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:79:"What makes SearchEngineOptimization.ae different from other Dubai SEO agencies?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:181:"We focus exclusively on measurable revenue outcomes, not vanity metrics. Every campaign includes conversion tracking, revenue attribution reporting, and a dedicated account manager.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:55:"Do you work with Dubai SMEs or only enterprise clients?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:98:"We work with businesses of all sizes — from ambitious startups to established enterprise brands.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:38:"What industries do you serve in Dubai?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:136:"Real estate, hospitality, healthcare, legal, finance, retail, e-commerce, construction, education, automotive, and SaaS/tech businesses.";}}'),
('1539', '105', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:46:"How is Abu Dhabi SEO different from Dubai SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:204:"Abu Dhabi has a higher proportion of Arabic-language searches, stronger government and B2B search intent, and a less saturated competitive landscape — often making it faster and more affordable to rank.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:43:"Which industries do you serve in Abu Dhabi?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:133:"Government suppliers, hospitality, healthcare, real estate, education, oil and gas support services, and professional services firms.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:50:"Do you optimise for Abu Dhabi Google Maps results?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:141:"Yes. Local pack optimisation is a core part of our Abu Dhabi SEO service, including GBP management, citation building, and review generation.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:29:"What does Abu Dhabi SEO cost?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:100:"Our Abu Dhabi SEO packages start from AED 2,500/month. Contact us for a free audit and custom quote.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:42:"Do you provide bilingual SEO in Abu Dhabi?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:120:"Yes — all Abu Dhabi campaigns include Arabic and English keyword research, content creation, and on-page optimisation.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:40:"How long to rank on page 1 in Abu Dhabi?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:151:"Typically 60–90 days for less competitive terms, and 4–6 months for highly competitive keywords in sectors like healthcare, real estate, and legal.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:51:"Can Abu Dhabi businesses rank across the whole UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:90:"Absolutely. We build city landing pages across all emirates to maximise national coverage.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:59:"Do you have experience with Abu Dhabi government suppliers?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:133:"Yes. We have optimised websites for companies that supply to Abu Dhabi government entities, including B2G focused keyword strategies.";}}'),
