('1550', '110', 'location_faqs', 'a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:41:"Does SEO work for real estate in the UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:169:"Yes — with 8M+ monthly property searches, SEO is the highest-ROI lead generation channel for UAE real estate. Our clients average cost-per-lead 80% lower than portals.";}i:1;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:54:"Can SEO help an off-plan developer rank before launch?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:150:"Yes. We build project landing pages and developer brand content well before launch, capturing early-stage research traffic and pre-registration leads.";}i:2;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:46:"Do you rank real estate agents in Google Maps?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:162:"Yes. Local pack optimisation — GBP management, review strategy, citation building — is core to our real estate SEO service for agencies with physical offices.";}i:3;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:53:"How long does real estate SEO take to generate leads?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:152:"Local agent searches rank in 60–90 days. Development and community-level content takes 3–5 months. Off-plan developer brand terms take 4–6 months.";}i:4;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:52:"Do you build community landing pages for developers?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:112:"Yes. We create and optimise individual community, tower, and project pages for every development in a portfolio.";}i:5;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:55:"Can you help us compete with Bayut and Property Finder?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:164:"Yes — by targeting ultra-specific, high-intent searches that portals cannot optimise for at unit level, and by ranking for developer and community brand searches.";}i:6;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:36:"Do you offer Arabic real estate SEO?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:104:"Yes — bilingual Arabic/English real estate SEO is standard for all campaigns targeting the UAE market.";}i:7;a:2:{s:12:"faq_question";s:42:"What does real estate SEO cost in the UAE?";s:10:"faq_answer";s:135:"Packages start from AED 3,500/month for agencies and AED 6,000/month for developers with large portfolios. Contact us for a free audit.";}}'),
