"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","content_width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"c980122","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"content_position":"middle"},"elements":[{"id":"da12d8d","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"\\n<section class=\\"section home-faq-section\\" style=\\"background:var(--color-muted-bg,#f0f4f8);padding:5rem 0;\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"section-header section-header--center\\" style=\\"margin-bottom:3.5rem;\\">\\n            <span class=\\"section-label\\">FAQ<\\/span>\\n            <h2 class=\\"section-header__title\\" style=\\"font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.75rem);color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.15;\\">Common Questions<br>About SEO in the UAE<\\/h2>\\n            <p class=\\"section-header__desc\\" style=\\"max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\\">Everything UAE businesses want to know before starting an SEO campaign \\u2014 answered clearly.<\\/p>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div style=\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;align-items:start;\\" class=\\"faq-grid-2col\\">\\n            <div style=\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;\\">\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-a-0\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">What are SEO services in Dubai?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-a-0\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">SEO services in Dubai help businesses rank higher on Google for searches made by UAE customers. This includes technical audits, on-page optimisation, keyword research, content creation, link building, and local SEO. The goal is to drive qualified organic traffic that converts into leads and revenue \\u2014 without the ongoing cost of paid advertising.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-a-1\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">Why does my business need SEO in the UAE?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-a-1\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">With internet penetration above 99% and millions of monthly searches for business services across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and the wider UAE, your customers are searching for what you offer right now. Without SEO, they find your competitors instead. Strong organic visibility is the most cost-effective, long-term customer acquisition channel available to UAE businesses.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-a-2\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">How long does SEO take to deliver results in the UAE?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-a-2\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Most UAE businesses see measurable ranking improvements within 60\\u201390 days. Meaningful organic traffic growth typically follows between months 3 and 6. Highly competitive sectors may require 6\\u201312 months for top-3 Google positions. Local and long-tail keyword wins often appear within the first 30 days.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-a-3\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">How much do SEO services cost in Dubai?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-a-3\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Dubai SEO retainers typically range from AED 3,000\\/month for local SME campaigns to AED 25,000+\\/month for competitive enterprise programmes. We offer transparent, fixed monthly pricing with no hidden fees and no lock-in contracts.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-a-4\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">Do you provide Local SEO for Dubai and Abu Dhabi businesses?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-a-4\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Yes \\u2014 local SEO is a core service. We optimise Google Business Profiles, build UAE-specific citation networks, create location-targeted landing pages, and implement local structured data to drive direct calls, enquiries, and foot traffic.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-a-5\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">Can you help my Google Business Profile rank higher?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-a-5\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Absolutely. We optimise every element of your Google Business Profile \\u2014 categories, services, posts, photos, Q&amp;A, and review management \\u2014 specifically for UAE map pack rankings. Our GBP clients regularly enter the Google Maps 3-pack within 60 days.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n            <\\/div>\\n            <div style=\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;\\">\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-b-0\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">What industries do you provide SEO services for?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-b-0\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">We serve every major UAE industry: real estate, healthcare, legal, financial services, hospitality, e-commerce, construction, logistics, education, restaurants, automotive, and technology. Each industry has a distinct search landscape \\u2014 our sector-specific experience means we deliver results from month one.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-b-1\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">Do you offer Arabic and English SEO services?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-b-1\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Yes \\u2014 bilingual Arabic and English SEO is a core offering. We conduct Arabic keyword research, produce native-quality Arabic content, and implement hreflang for bilingual sites. In the UAE market, Arabic SEO can double your addressable organic audience.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-b-2\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">What&#039;s included in your monthly SEO packages?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-b-2\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Monthly retainers include: dedicated SEO strategist, full technical audit and implementation, keyword research and content strategy, on-page optimisation, content creation, link building outreach, Google Business Profile management, weekly rank tracking, and a monthly performance review call.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-b-3\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">Do you optimize websites for Google AI Overviews and ChatGPT?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-b-3\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">Yes \\u2014 AI search optimisation (GEO\\/AIO) is a dedicated service. We structure your content, implement comprehensive schema markup, and build the entity authority signals that cause AI search engines to cite your brand in generated answers.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-b-4\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">How do you measure SEO success and ROI?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-b-4\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">We track keyword rankings, organic traffic, organic lead volume, conversion rates, and revenue attribution \\u2014 not vanity metrics. Every client receives a live dashboard, weekly automated rank reports, and monthly strategy calls tied directly to business outcomes.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div class=\\"hfaq-item\\" style=\\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\\">\\n            <button class=\\"hfaq-trigger\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-controls=\\"hfaq-b-5\\" style=\\"width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--color-heading,#101A6A);line-height:1.35;\\">Why choose SearchEngineOptimization.ae as your UAE SEO agency?<\\/span>\\n                <span class=\\"hfaq-icon\\" style=\\"flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .2s,transform .2s;\\"><svg width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"#fff\\" stroke-width=\\"3\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"\\/><\\/svg><\\/span>\\n            <\\/button>\\n            <div id=\\"hfaq-b-5\\" class=\\"hfaq-body\\" style=\\"display:none;padding:0 1.35rem 1.2rem;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--color-body,#4a5568);line-height:1.75;\\">We are a UAE-specialist agency \\u2014 not a global generalist. We have served 345+ UAE businesses across every major sector, deliver full bilingual Arabic and English SEO, and focus exclusively on revenue outcomes. No lock-in contracts, transparent pricing, and a track record of measurable organic growth.<\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n            <\\/div>\\n        <\\/div>\\n        <div style=\\"text-align:center;margin-top:3rem;padding:2.5rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#101A6A 0%,#1a2d8a 100%);border-radius:20px;\\">\\n            <p style=\\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:.9375rem;margin-bottom:1rem;\\">Still have questions? Talk to a UAE SEO specialist \\u2014 no sales pressure.<\\/p>\\n            <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\" class=\\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\\" style=\\"background:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4);color:#fff;\\">Get a Free SEO Consultation \\u2192<\\/a>\\n        <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>\\n<style>\\n.hfaq-item:hover{border-color:var(--color-primary,#16B1D4)!important;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(22,177,212,.10);}\\n.hfaq-trigger[aria-expanded=\\"true\\"] .hfaq-icon{background:var(--color-heading,#101A6A)!important;transform:rotate(45deg);}\\n@media(max-width:768px){.faq-grid-2col{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}}\\n<\\/style>\\n<script>\\n(function(){document.querySelectorAll(\\".hfaq-trigger\\").forEach(function(btn){btn.addEventListener(\\"click\\",function(){var open=this.getAttribute(\\"aria-expanded\\")===\\"true\\";var body=document.getElementById(this.getAttribute(\\"aria-controls\\"));if(!body)return;this.setAttribute(\\"aria-expanded\\",open?\\"false\\":\\"true\\");body.style.display=open?\\"none\\":\\"block\\";});});})();\\n<\\/script>"}}]}]},{"id":"e530e73","elType":"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","content_width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"bb50245","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"content_position":"middle"},"elements":[{"id":"b32fd57","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"\\n<section class=\\"cta-dark\\" style=\\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a2540 0%,#101A6A 100%);padding:5rem 0;text-align:center;\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <span style=\\"display:inline-block;background:rgba(22,177,212,.15);color:#16B1D4;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.35rem .85rem;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:1.25rem;border:1px solid rgba(22,177,212,.3);\\">Start Today<\\/span>\\n        <h2 style=\\"color:#fff;font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:1rem;\\">Ready to Dominate<br>Search in the UAE?<\\/h2>\\n        <p style=\\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:1.0625rem;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto 2rem;line-height:1.7;\\">Get your free SEO audit \\u2014 we\'ll show you exactly where you\'re losing rankings and how to win them back. No obligation, results within 48 hours.<\\/p>\\n        <div style=\\"display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\\">\\n            <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\" class=\\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\\">Get Free SEO Audit \\u2192<\\/a>\\n            <a href=\\"\\/case-studies\\/\\" style=\\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:.875rem 1.5rem;\\">View Case Studies \\u2197<\\/a>\\n        <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>"}}]}]}]'),
