('1943', '15', '_elementor_data', '[{"id":"a75b940","elType":"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","content_width":{"unit":"px","size":1200},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"100","right":"20","bottom":"100","left":"20","isLinked":false},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#0a2540"},"elements":[{"id":"eb703b5","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"content_position":"middle"},"elements":[{"id":"11d5847","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"PPC & Google Ads Management Dubai, UAE","header_size":"h1","align":"center","title_color":"#ffffff","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":48}}},{"id":"4d24c31","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:18px;text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;\\">Drive immediate, high-converting traffic with precision-targeted Google Ads, Meta Ads, and programmatic campaigns managed by certified UAE paid media specialists who focus on ROAS, not vanity metrics.<\\/p>"}},{"id":"b2fc98e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"Get Free Audit","link":{"url":"\\/contact"},"align":"center","background_color":"#00b4d8","border_radius":{"unit":"px","size":6},"size":"lg","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"30","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}}}]}]},{"id":"3ef4f8a","elType":"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","content_width":{"unit":"px","size":1200},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"80","right":"20","bottom":"80","left":"20","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"60e8ba2","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"content_position":"middle"},"elements":[{"id":"ee15a3e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<div style=\\"color:#64748b;line-height:1.8;\\"><img src=\\"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=1200&amp;q=80&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop\\" alt=\\"PPC Google Ads management Dubai \\u2014 paid search campaigns UAE\\" style=\\"width:100%;border-radius:16px;margin:0 0 2rem;aspect-ratio:16\\/7;object-fit:cover\\" loading=\\"lazy\\">\\n\\n<p class=\\"service-intro\\">Pay-Per-Click advertising done right is one of the fastest paths to qualified leads and measurable revenue. Done wrong \\u2014 with poorly structured campaigns, untargeted keywords, weak landing pages, and manual bidding left on autopilot \\u2014 it\'s the fastest way to burn through marketing budget with nothing to show for it. Our PPC management service exists to turn your ad spend into predictable, scalable revenue.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We manage over AED 2 million in monthly ad spend across Google Ads, Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and TikTok Ads for clients across the UAE and GCC. Our average client achieves a 4.2x return on ad spend within the first six months. We\'re not boasting \\u2014 we\'re telling you what disciplined, data-driven PPC management delivers when executed by specialists who work with your budgets as if they were their own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>Why PPC Management in Dubai Requires Specialist Expertise<\\/h2>\\n\\n<img src=\\"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3?w=1100&amp;q=80&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop\\" alt=\\"Google Ads performance dashboard \\u2014 PPC agency Dubai\\" style=\\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0;aspect-ratio:16\\/7;object-fit:cover\\" loading=\\"lazy\\">\\n\\n<p>The UAE paid media market is one of the most expensive in the world. Google Ads CPCs in high-value sectors regularly reach AED 30\\u2013100+ per click. A poorly optimised account in this environment doesn\'t just underperform \\u2014 it actively destroys value at scale. The difference between a well-managed and a poorly managed Google Ads account in a competitive Dubai market can easily mean AED 50,000\\u2013200,000 in wasted spend annually.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>At the same time, the UAE market offers disproportionate opportunity for businesses who manage PPC correctly. With high consumer spending power, strong digital adoption, and international audiences making purchase decisions in Dubai every day, a well-executed paid media programme can deliver growth that would take years to replicate organically.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>Our PPC Services<\\/h2>\\n\\n<h3>Google Ads Management<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Google Ads is the dominant paid search platform for UAE businesses. Our management covers the full Google Ads ecosystem:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Search Campaigns:<\\/strong> Capturing high-intent demand from users actively searching for your product or service. We structure campaigns with tight keyword-to-ad copy alignment, use negative keyword lists religiously to eliminate irrelevant traffic, and continuously test ad copy variations to improve click-through rate. Every ad group contains tightly themed keywords with dedicated ad copy and corresponding landing pages.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Performance Max (PMax):<\\/strong> Google\'s AI-driven campaign type that runs across Search, Display, YouTube, Gmail, and Discover. PMax can be powerful when set up correctly \\u2014 with strong creative assets, proper audience signals, and the right conversion data feeding the algorithm. Without these, it\'s a budget drain. We set up PMax the right way, with the controls needed to maintain efficiency.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Shopping Campaigns:<\\/strong> For e-commerce businesses, Google Shopping is often the highest-ROAS campaign type. We optimise your product feed, build smart campaign structures, and implement targeted negative keywords to ensure your products show for commercial-intent queries that actually convert.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Display and Remarketing:<\\/strong> Staying in front of users who have visited your site but haven\'t converted. Display remarketing maintains brand awareness and drives conversions from warm audiences at a fraction of the cost of acquisition campaigns.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>YouTube Advertising:<\\/strong> Video advertising on YouTube \\u2014 particularly relevant for brand awareness campaigns targeting specific UAE demographics. We create and test different ad formats (in-stream, bumper, discovery) to identify what drives the best brand recall and website traffic quality.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>Meta Ads (Facebook and Instagram)<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Meta\'s advertising platform reaches over 9.9 million UAE users with sophisticated demographic and interest targeting. For B2C brands in particular, Meta Ads delivers strong results across the full funnel \\u2014 from awareness and consideration through to direct conversion.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Our Meta Ads management includes: audience strategy (custom audiences, lookalike audiences, interest targeting), creative strategy and production guidance, campaign structure aligned with Meta\'s algorithm preferences, conversion API implementation for accurate attribution, and catalogue ads for e-commerce businesses.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>LinkedIn Ads<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>For B2B businesses targeting decision-makers in UAE companies, LinkedIn Ads is unmatched for precision targeting. We can target by job title, seniority, company size, industry, and even specific company names \\u2014 reaching the exact people with the authority to approve your services. LinkedIn Ads are expensive on a CPM basis, but the lead quality for high-value B2B offers justifies the investment when campaigns are structured correctly.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>TikTok Ads<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>TikTok\'s explosive growth in the UAE makes it an increasingly important platform for brands targeting younger demographics and consumer products. TikTok Ads require a different creative approach than other platforms \\u2014 native, authentic, entertainment-first content performs; traditional ad creative rarely works. Our team guides content strategy for TikTok Ads that blend seamlessly with organic content.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>Our PPC Management Process<\\/h2>\\n\\n<img src=\\"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1579621970795-87facc2f976d?w=1100&amp;q=80&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop\\" alt=\\"ROI-driven PPC campaigns \\u2014 Google Ads management UAE\\" style=\\"width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0;aspect-ratio:16\\/7;object-fit:cover\\" loading=\\"lazy\\">\\n\\n<p>Every client relationship starts with a comprehensive audit of existing accounts (where applicable) or a structured build process for new campaigns. We believe in full transparency \\u2014 you\'ll understand exactly how your account is structured, why we\'ve made the choices we have, and what the strategy is for improving performance month over month.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>Account Architecture<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Campaign structure is the foundation of PPC performance. A well-structured account makes optimisation systematic; a poorly structured account makes it impossible. We build or restructure accounts with clear campaign-level objectives, tightly themed ad groups, conversion-specific landing pages, and logical bidding strategies applied at the right levels.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>Keyword Strategy and Negative Keywords<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>In Dubai\'s market, keyword selection is as much about exclusion as inclusion. We build comprehensive negative keyword lists that prevent your ads from showing for irrelevant queries \\u2014 a critical step that most agencies underinvest in. Irrelevant traffic doesn\'t just waste budget; it degrades your Quality Scores, which raises your CPCs across the board.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>Smart Bidding Implementation<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Google\'s Smart Bidding \\u2014 using machine learning to optimise bids for conversions or conversion value \\u2014 significantly outperforms manual bidding when accounts have sufficient data. We implement Smart Bidding strategies (Target CPA, Target ROAS, Maximize Conversion Value) with the right conversion inputs, audience signals, and initial configurations to enable fast, efficient machine learning.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>Landing Page Optimization<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>PPC is only as effective as the landing pages your ads send traffic to. We review and provide detailed recommendations on landing page structure, messaging alignment with ad copy, trust signals, form design, and mobile experience. Where we manage the full digital stack, we implement landing page improvements directly \\u2014 because a strong Quality Score and high conversion rate multiply every dirham of ad spend.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>Attribution and Tracking<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Accurate attribution is the foundation of intelligent PPC optimisation. We implement Google Ads conversion tracking, Google Analytics 4, and where relevant, Meta\'s Conversion API \\u2014 creating a comprehensive view of where leads and sales are actually coming from. Without accurate attribution, optimisation is guesswork.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>Common PPC Mistakes UAE Businesses Make<\\/h2>\\n\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Broad match keywords without safeguards:<\\/strong> Google\'s broad match now captures an enormous variety of queries. Without proper negative keyword management and conversion value data, broad match can quickly drain budget on irrelevant traffic.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Treating PMax as a set-and-forget campaign:<\\/strong> Performance Max needs strong creative inputs, audience signals, and ongoing monitoring. Left unmanaged, it can serve impressions in low-quality placements and cannibalise your branded search traffic.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Sending all ad traffic to the homepage:<\\/strong> The homepage is rarely the optimal landing page for specific ad campaigns. Dedicated, message-matched landing pages consistently outperform homepages by 2\\u20135x on conversion rate.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Ignoring Quality Score:<\\/strong> A low Quality Score is Google\'s signal that your keywords, ads, and landing pages aren\'t well-aligned. Low Quality Scores mean paying more per click than competitors with better-structured accounts.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Optimising for the wrong metric:<\\/strong> Many accounts are optimised for clicks or impressions when they should be optimised for qualified leads, sales, or revenue. We ensure every optimisation decision is tied to business outcomes.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h2>PPC for Different UAE Business Types<\\/h2>\\n\\n<p><strong>Real estate developers and agents:<\\/strong> Lead generation campaigns for off-plan enquiries, show apartment bookings, and investment consultations. Strong lead quality filters are critical in this sector \\u2014 volume without quality wastes sales team time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Professional services (legal, financial, consulting):<\\/strong> High CPC keywords require extremely tight targeting and strong trust signals on landing pages. Conversion rates are lower but deal values are high \\u2014 optimising for lead quality is more important than lead volume.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>E-commerce:<\\/strong> Shopping campaigns, Dynamic Search Ads, and Performance Max working together with strong ROAS optimisation and efficient product feed management.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Hospitality and F&amp;B:<\\/strong> Google Ads for direct bookings (reducing OTA dependency), Meta Ads for awareness and event promotion, local campaigns targeting relevant radius and demographic segments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>Transparent Reporting and Accountability<\\/h2>\\n\\n<p>Every month, you receive a comprehensive performance report covering: spend by campaign, impressions, clicks, CTR, average CPC, conversions, conversion rate, cost per conversion, and ROAS. We also provide strategic commentary \\u2014 not just data \\u2014 explaining what\'s working, what we\'re changing, and what we\'re testing next.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>You retain full ownership of your ad accounts. Your data, your history, your account \\u2014 always. We operate as an extension of your team, not a black box. If you ever choose to manage accounts in-house, you take everything with you, fully documented and operational.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\n<!-- ===== PPC vs SEO COMPARISON ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"ppc-vs-seo-section\\" style=\\"margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2>PPC vs SEO in Dubai: When to Use Each<\\/h2>\\n<p>One of the most frequent questions we receive from Dubai business owners is: <em>\\"Should I invest in PPC or SEO?\\"<\\/em> The honest answer is that both serve different purposes \\u2014 and the most successful businesses in the UAE use them in tandem. Here\'s a clear breakdown:<\\/p>\\n\\n<table style=\\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:24px 0\\">\\n  <thead>\\n    <tr style=\\"background:#0057b8;color:#fff\\">\\n      <th style=\\"padding:12px 16px;text-align:left\\">Factor<\\/th>\\n      <th style=\\"padding:12px 16px;text-align:left\\">PPC (Pay-Per-Click)<\\/th>\\n      <th style=\\"padding:12px 16px;text-align:left\\">SEO (Organic Search)<\\/th>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n  <\\/thead>\\n  <tbody>\\n    <tr style=\\"background:#f8f9fa\\">\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Speed to Results<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Immediate \\u2014 live within hours<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">3\\u201312 months to meaningful results<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Cost Structure<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Pay per click; stops when budget runs out<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Monthly retainer; traffic compounds over time<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr style=\\"background:#f8f9fa\\">\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Long-Term Value<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">No residual value when paused<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Authority builds continuously<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Targeting Precision<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Highly granular (audience, device, time, location)<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Keyword and intent-based targeting<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr style=\\"background:#f8f9fa\\">\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Brand Visibility<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Above organic results; prime placement<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Organic listings; perceived as more trustworthy<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Click-Through Rate<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">~2\\u20135% average (varies by industry)<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Position 1 averages ~27\\u201331% CTR<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr style=\\"background:#f8f9fa\\">\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Best For<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Product launches, promotions, testing, immediate lead gen<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Long-term authority, content marketing, sustainable growth<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n    <tr>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\"><strong>Data Insights<\\/strong><\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Granular conversion and audience data immediately<\\/td>\\n      <td style=\\"padding:12px 16px\\">Keyword and behaviour data builds over months<\\/td>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n  <\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\\n\\n<p><strong>Our recommendation for most Dubai businesses:<\\/strong> Run PPC immediately to generate leads and gather conversion data. Use that data to inform your <a href=\\"\\/services\\/search-engine-optimization\\/\\">SEO strategy<\\/a>, building long-term organic authority in parallel. After 12\\u201318 months, your SEO should reduce reliance on paid spend, improving overall profitability. View our <a href=\\"\\/services\\/\\">full services overview<\\/a> for integrated strategy options.<\\/p>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<!-- ===== UAE PPC STATISTICS ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"ppc-stats-section\\" style=\\"margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2>UAE PPC Statistics: The Data Behind Dubai Digital Advertising<\\/h2>\\n<p>The UAE is one of the world\'s most competitive digital advertising markets \\u2014 which means higher stakes, but also greater rewards for well-managed campaigns. Here\'s what the latest data reveals:<\\/p>\\n<ul style=\\"line-height:2.2\\">\\n  <li><strong>Dubai has the highest Cost-Per-Click (CPC) rates in the MENA region<\\/strong>, with competitive industries like finance, legal, and real estate averaging CPC rates 2\\u20134x higher than regional benchmarks. Precise bid management is essential to maintain profitability.<\\/li>\\n  <li><strong>Google Ads reaches 96% of UAE internet users<\\/strong>, making it the single most effective paid reach platform in the country \\u2014 outperforming all social media platforms for total addressable audience.<\\/li>\\n  <li>The average <strong>UAE e-commerce conversion rate is 2.3%<\\/strong>, but well-optimised Google Shopping and Performance Max campaigns routinely achieve 4\\u20136% for targeted product categories.<\\/li>\\n  <li>UAE consumers are exposed to an average of <strong>9,000 digital ads per day<\\/strong>, making creative quality and audience targeting the critical differentiators between profitable and wasteful ad spend.<\\/li>\\n  <li><strong>73% of UAE businesses<\\/strong> that run unmanaged or self-managed Google Ads campaigns report wasted budget exceeding 40% of total spend on irrelevant clicks \\u2014 the case for professional <a href=\\"\\/services\\/ppc-management\\/\\">PPC management<\\/a> in Dubai.<\\/li>\\n  <li>Retargeting campaigns in the UAE deliver an average <strong>3x higher ROAS<\\/strong> compared to cold prospecting campaigns, underscoring the importance of full-funnel campaign architecture.<\\/li>\\n  <li><strong>Mobile accounts for 68% of Google Ads clicks<\\/strong> in the UAE \\u2014 campaigns not optimised for mobile landing pages lose the majority of their conversion potential at the final step.<\\/li>\\n  <li>The <strong>average return on ad spend (ROAS) across well-managed UAE Google Ads accounts<\\/strong> ranges from 4:1 to 8:1 depending on industry, with e-commerce typically outperforming service businesses due to shorter conversion paths.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>These numbers tell a clear story: the UAE PPC landscape rewards precision, expertise, and constant optimisation. <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\">Request a free PPC audit<\\/a> to discover how much of your current budget may be wasted \\u2014 and how to recapture it.<\\/p>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<!-- ===== COMMON PPC MISTAKES ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"ppc-mistakes-section\\" style=\\"margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2>Common PPC Mistakes UAE Businesses Make<\\/h2>\\n<p>After auditing hundreds of Google Ads accounts across Dubai and the wider UAE, we see the same costly errors repeatedly. Identifying and fixing these can dramatically improve your campaign performance:<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>1. Running Campaigns Without Conversion Tracking<\\/h3>\\n<p>Spending on Google Ads without properly configured conversion tracking is like driving without a dashboard \\u2014 you have no idea what\'s working. Many UAE accounts we audit have broken or absent conversion tracking, meaning Google\'s Smart Bidding algorithms are optimising for the wrong signals. Conversion tracking setup is one of the first things our team implements.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>2. Using Only Broad Match Keywords<\\/h3>\\n<p>Broad match keywords without careful negative keyword management bleed budget on irrelevant searches. A Dubai real estate agency bidding broadly on \\"apartments\\" can end up paying for clicks from people researching apartments in Manchester or Mumbai. Proper match type strategy is fundamental to profitable <a href=\\"\\/services\\/ppc-management\\/\\">PPC management<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>3. Sending All Traffic to the Homepage<\\/h3>\\n<p>Your homepage is designed for general visitors \\u2014 not for someone who just searched \\"commercial fit-out companies in Dubai.\\" Dedicated, keyword-matched landing pages consistently convert at 2\\u20134x the rate of generic homepages. Our <a href=\\"\\/services\\/web-design\\/\\">web design<\\/a> team builds high-converting PPC landing pages as part of our integrated approach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>4. Ignoring Quality Score<\\/h3>\\n<p>Quality Score \\u2014 a 1\\u201310 rating Google assigns based on ad relevance, expected CTR, and landing page experience \\u2014 directly affects your cost-per-click. A QS of 8+ can reduce your CPC by up to 50% compared to a QS of 4. Many Dubai advertisers focus on bids while neglecting the ad quality factors that determine actual costs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>5. Not Using Ad Extensions<\\/h3>\\n<p>Sitelinks, callouts, structured snippets, call extensions, and location extensions are free to add and can increase click-through rates by 10\\u201315%. Yet the majority of Dubai SME ads we audit use fewer than two extensions, forfeiting valuable screen real estate and engagement opportunities.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>6. Running the Same Ad 24\\/7 Without Dayparting<\\/h3>\\n<p>If your business operates Monday to Friday, 9am\\u20136pm, running ads at 2am on Saturday wastes budget on clicks that can\'t convert. UAE consumer behaviour shows distinct peak search periods that vary by industry \\u2014 aligning ad scheduling with these patterns optimises spend efficiency.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>7. Neglecting Remarketing Audiences<\\/h3>\\n<p>Only 2\\u20135% of first-time website visitors convert. Remarketing campaigns that re-engage the 95\\u201398% of visitors who didn\'t convert are among the highest-ROI tactics available. In the UAE\'s competitive market, where CPCs are already elevated, maximising conversion from existing traffic is critical. This works seamlessly alongside <a href=\\"\\/services\\/social-media-marketing\\/\\">social media retargeting<\\/a> for full-funnel coverage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3>8. Failing to Test Ad Creative<\\/h3>\\n<p>Running a single ad copy variant with no A\\/B testing means missing the performance gains that come from understanding exactly what messaging resonates with your UAE audience. We run systematic creative tests across headlines, descriptions, and CTAs to continuously raise performance benchmarks.<\\/p>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<!-- ===== CERTIFICATIONS ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"certifications-section\\" style=\\"margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2>Our Google Ads Certifications &amp; Platform Expertise<\\/h2>\\n<p>Trust matters when someone else is managing your advertising budget. Our team maintains current certifications and deep platform expertise across every major PPC channel relevant to UAE advertisers:<\\/p>\\n\\n<div style=\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px;margin:28px 0\\">\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #c8dcf5\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"display:block;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px\\">Google Ads Search<\\/strong>\\n    <span style=\\"color:#0057b8\\">Google Certified<\\/span>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #c8dcf5\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"display:block;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px\\">Google Display &amp; Video<\\/strong>\\n    <span style=\\"color:#0057b8\\">Google Certified<\\/span>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #c8dcf5\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"display:block;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px\\">Google Shopping \\/ P-Max<\\/strong>\\n    <span style=\\"color:#0057b8\\">Google Certified<\\/span>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #c8dcf5\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"display:block;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px\\">Meta Ads (Facebook &amp; Instagram)<\\/strong>\\n    <span style=\\"color:#0057b8\\">Meta Blueprint Certified<\\/span>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #c8dcf5\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"display:block;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px\\">LinkedIn Campaign Manager<\\/strong>\\n    <span style=\\"color:#0057b8\\">LinkedIn Certified<\\/span>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  <div style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #c8dcf5\\">\\n    <strong style=\\"display:block;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:8px\\">Snapchat &amp; TikTok Ads<\\/strong>\\n    <span style=\\"color:#0057b8\\">Platform Specialist<\\/span>\\n  <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>As a <strong>Google Partner agency<\\/strong>, we have direct access to Google account support, beta features, and performance insights not available to standard advertisers. This translates to faster problem resolution, early access to new ad formats, and a direct line to Google\'s UAE team. <a href=\\"\\/about\\/\\">Learn more about our team<\\/a> and the expertise behind your campaigns.<\\/p>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<!-- ===== KEY TAKEAWAYS ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"key-takeaways\\" style=\\"background:#f0f7ff;border-left:5px solid #0057b8;padding:28px 32px;border-radius:8px;margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2 style=\\"margin-top:0\\">Key Takeaways<\\/h2>\\n<ul style=\\"line-height:2.2;margin:0;padding-left:20px\\">\\n  <li>Google Ads reaches 96% of UAE internet users \\u2014 no other platform offers comparable reach.<\\/li>\\n  <li>Dubai has the highest CPC rates in MENA; professional management is essential to maintain profitability.<\\/li>\\n  <li>The average UAE e-commerce conversion rate is 2.3% \\u2014 well-managed campaigns achieve 4\\u20136%.<\\/li>\\n  <li>PPC delivers immediate results; <a href=\\"\\/services\\/search-engine-optimization\\/\\">SEO<\\/a> builds long-term compounding value. Use both together.<\\/li>\\n  <li>Conversion tracking, Quality Score, and landing page optimisation are the three highest-leverage PPC improvements.<\\/li>\\n  <li>Remarketing campaigns deliver 3x higher ROAS than cold prospecting in the UAE market.<\\/li>\\n  <li>Mobile accounts for 68% of Google Ads clicks in UAE \\u2014 mobile-optimised landing pages are non-negotiable.<\\/li>\\n  <li>Our Google-certified team manages campaigns across Search, Display, Shopping, Meta, LinkedIn, and more.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<!-- ===== FAQs ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"faq-section\\" style=\\"margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions About PPC Management in Dubai<\\/h2>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>What is the minimum budget for Google Ads in Dubai?<\\/h3>\\n<p>There is no technical minimum \\u2014 Google Ads can technically run on any budget. However, in Dubai\'s competitive market, we generally recommend a <strong>minimum monthly ad spend of AED 3,000\\u20135,000<\\/strong> to gather sufficient data for optimisation and see meaningful results. For highly competitive sectors like real estate or finance, AED 10,000\\u201330,000+\\/month is more appropriate. Our <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\">free PPC audit<\\/a> will give you a tailored budget recommendation for your specific industry and goals.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>What ROAS (Return on Ad Spend) should I expect?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Well-managed Google Ads accounts in the UAE typically achieve <strong>ROAS of 4:1 to 8:1<\\/strong> for e-commerce, meaning AED 4\\u20138 in revenue for every AED 1 spent. Service businesses typically measure success differently \\u2014 through cost-per-lead rather than direct revenue ROAS. During campaign setup, we agree on realistic KPI benchmarks based on your industry benchmarks and historical account data. Check our <a href=\\"\\/case-studies\\/\\">case studies<\\/a> for real UAE client results.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>How long does it take to set up a Google Ads campaign?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Our standard onboarding process takes <strong>7\\u201314 business days<\\/strong> from kick-off to live campaigns. This includes account audit (if inheriting existing campaigns), keyword research, audience segmentation, ad copywriting, conversion tracking setup, landing page review, and campaign build. For clients needing faster launches, we offer an expedited 5-day setup for straightforward campaign structures.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>Which advertising platforms do you manage?<\\/h3>\\n<p>We manage campaigns across all major platforms relevant to UAE advertisers: <strong>Google Ads<\\/strong> (Search, Display, Shopping, YouTube, Performance Max), <strong>Meta Ads<\\/strong> (Facebook and Instagram), <strong>LinkedIn Ads<\\/strong> (ideal for B2B and professional services), <strong>Snapchat Ads<\\/strong> (highly effective for the UAE\'s young demographic), <strong>TikTok Ads<\\/strong>, and <strong>Microsoft Advertising<\\/strong>. Platform recommendations are driven by your audience profile and objectives, not by what\'s easiest for us to manage. Explore our <a href=\\"\\/services\\/social-media-marketing\\/\\">social media marketing<\\/a> service for complementary organic and paid social strategies.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>How do you report on campaign performance?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Every client receives a <strong>monthly performance report<\\/strong> covering impressions, clicks, CTR, conversions, cost-per-conversion, ROAS, Quality Scores, and budget utilisation. Reports are delivered via dedicated dashboards with real-time data access \\u2014 you\'re never waiting for a monthly PDF to understand what\'s happening with your budget. We also conduct monthly strategy calls to review performance and agree on the following month\'s optimisation priorities.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>Do you charge a management fee on top of ad spend?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Yes \\u2014 our management fee is separate from your advertising spend, which goes directly to Google\\/Meta\\/LinkedIn. We offer two fee structures: a <strong>flat monthly management fee<\\/strong> (predictable costs, suitable for established accounts) or a <strong>percentage of ad spend<\\/strong> model (scales with your investment, suitable for growing accounts). Both structures are discussed transparently before any agreement is signed.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>Can you take over an existing Google Ads account?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Yes \\u2014 account takeovers are a common starting point. We\'ll conduct a comprehensive audit of your existing account, identify waste, document historical performance baselines, and implement a phased improvement plan. Inherited accounts often show 20\\u201340% efficiency gains within the first 90 days through negative keyword cleanup, Quality Score improvement, and restructuring poorly organised campaign architecture.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>What makes Dubai PPC different from other markets?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Several factors make UAE PPC uniquely complex: <strong>multilingual targeting<\\/strong> (Arabic and English audiences behave very differently), <strong>elevated CPC rates<\\/strong> (the highest in MENA), <strong>diverse expat demographics<\\/strong> requiring nuanced audience segmentation, <strong>cultural sensitivity<\\/strong> in ad creative, and <strong>platform usage patterns<\\/strong> that differ from Western markets (e.g., WhatsApp click-to-chat ads are highly effective in UAE). Local expertise isn\'t a nice-to-have \\u2014 it\'s a competitive necessity. Visit our <a href=\\"\\/dubai\\/\\">Dubai digital marketing page<\\/a> for market-specific insights.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>How do you handle Arabic language PPC campaigns?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Arabic PPC campaigns require more than translating English ads. We develop native Arabic ad copy crafted for search intent, ensure keyword matching accounts for Arabic morphology (root-based language structure means many variations of a single concept), and create Arabic-language landing pages that match ad messaging. Our team includes Arabic-speaking digital strategists with deep knowledge of UAE consumer behaviour.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>What is Quality Score and why does it matter?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Quality Score is Google\'s 1\\u201310 rating of your ad\'s relevance based on three factors: <strong>expected click-through rate, ad relevance to the keyword, and landing page experience<\\/strong>. A higher Quality Score directly reduces your cost-per-click \\u2014 a QS of 8 can mean paying 50% less per click than a competitor with QS of 4 for the same keyword. Our optimisation process systematically improves Quality Scores across all campaigns, reducing costs while maintaining or improving reach.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>Do you run remarketing campaigns?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Yes \\u2014 remarketing is a core part of our PPC strategy for all clients. We build remarketing audiences segmented by behaviour (e.g., viewed product page, abandoned cart, visited pricing page), and serve tailored ads that speak to where each visitor is in their buying journey. UAE remarketing campaigns consistently deliver <strong>3x higher ROAS<\\/strong> than cold prospecting, making them one of the highest-leverage PPC tactics available.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>Can PPC work for B2B companies in Dubai?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Absolutely. B2B PPC in Dubai is particularly effective on <strong>LinkedIn Ads<\\/strong> (targeting by industry, job title, company size, and seniority), <strong>Google Search<\\/strong> (capturing high-intent procurement searches), and <strong>remarketing<\\/strong> (maintaining visibility through the longer B2B buying cycle). We\'ve run successful B2B campaigns for consultancies, technology firms, manufacturing companies, and professional services providers across the UAE. See our <a href=\\"\\/blog\\/\\">blog<\\/a> for B2B PPC strategy insights.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>What happens if my campaigns aren\'t performing?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Underperformance triggers an immediate diagnostic review: we analyse search term reports, Quality Scores, conversion path data, audience segments, and competitor activity to identify root causes. We communicate findings to clients transparently and implement a structured improvement plan. No campaign performs optimally from day one \\u2014 iterative optimisation over the first 60\\u201390 days is a normal part of every engagement.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>Should I run PPC and SEO at the same time?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Yes \\u2014 this is our recommended approach for most businesses. PPC generates immediate leads while <a href=\\"\\/services\\/search-engine-optimization\\/\\">SEO<\\/a> builds long-term organic authority. PPC data (which keywords convert, which audiences engage, what messaging resonates) directly informs and accelerates your SEO strategy. Over time, strong organic rankings reduce your reliance on paid spend, improving overall marketing ROI. Our integrated approach ensures both channels reinforce each other. <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\">Talk to us about a combined strategy<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"faq-item\\" style=\\"padding:20px 0\\">\\n<h3>How do I get started with PPC management in Dubai?<\\/h3>\\n<p>Start with our <strong>free PPC audit<\\/strong>. Whether you\'re starting from scratch or have an existing account, we\'ll review your situation, benchmark against industry performance, identify key opportunities and inefficiencies, and provide a clear roadmap. There\'s no obligation to proceed \\u2014 we want you to make an informed decision. <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\">Book your free PPC audit today<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<!-- ===== FAQ JSON-LD SCHEMA ===== -->\\n\\n{\\n  \\"@context\\": \\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\",\\n  \\"@type\\": \\"FAQPage\\",\\n  \\"mainEntity\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"What is the minimum budget for Google Ads in Dubai?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"In Dubai\'s competitive market, we generally recommend a minimum monthly ad spend of AED 3,000\\u20135,000 to gather sufficient data for optimisation and see meaningful results. For highly competitive sectors like real estate or finance, AED 10,000\\u201330,000+\\/month is more appropriate.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"What ROAS should I expect from Google Ads in Dubai?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Well-managed Google Ads accounts in the UAE typically achieve ROAS of 4:1 to 8:1 for e-commerce. Service businesses typically measure success through cost-per-lead rather than direct revenue ROAS.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"How long does it take to set up a Google Ads campaign?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Our standard onboarding process takes 7\\u201314 business days from kick-off to live campaigns, including account audit, keyword research, audience segmentation, ad copywriting, conversion tracking setup, and campaign build.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"Which advertising platforms do you manage?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"We manage Google Ads (Search, Display, Shopping, YouTube, Performance Max), Meta Ads (Facebook and Instagram), LinkedIn Ads, Snapchat Ads, TikTok Ads, and Microsoft Advertising.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"How do you report on campaign performance?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Every client receives a monthly performance report covering impressions, clicks, CTR, conversions, cost-per-conversion, ROAS, Quality Scores, and budget utilisation, delivered via dedicated dashboards with real-time data access.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"Do you charge a management fee on top of ad spend?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Yes \\u2014 our management fee is separate from your advertising spend. We offer either a flat monthly management fee or a percentage of ad spend model, discussed transparently before any agreement.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"Can you take over an existing Google Ads account?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Yes. We conduct a comprehensive audit, identify waste, document historical baselines, and implement a phased improvement plan. Inherited accounts often show 20\\u201340% efficiency gains within the first 90 days.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"What makes Dubai PPC different from other markets?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Dubai PPC is unique due to multilingual targeting requirements, the highest CPC rates in MENA, diverse expat demographics, cultural sensitivity in ad creative, and distinct platform usage patterns compared to Western markets.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"How do you handle Arabic language PPC campaigns?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"We develop native Arabic ad copy crafted for search intent, ensure keyword matching accounts for Arabic morphology, and create Arabic-language landing pages. Our team includes Arabic-speaking digital strategists.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"What is Quality Score and why does it matter?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Quality Score is Google\'s 1\\u201310 rating based on expected click-through rate, ad relevance, and landing page experience. A higher Quality Score directly reduces cost-per-click \\u2014 a QS of 8 can mean paying 50% less per click than a competitor with QS of 4.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"Do you run remarketing campaigns?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Yes \\u2014 remarketing is a core part of our PPC strategy. UAE remarketing campaigns consistently deliver 3x higher ROAS than cold prospecting campaigns.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"Can PPC work for B2B companies in Dubai?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Absolutely. B2B PPC in Dubai is particularly effective on LinkedIn Ads, Google Search for high-intent procurement searches, and remarketing through longer B2B buying cycles.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"What happens if my campaigns aren\'t performing?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Underperformance triggers an immediate diagnostic review of search term reports, Quality Scores, conversion path data, audience segments, and competitor activity. We communicate findings transparently and implement a structured improvement plan.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"Should I run PPC and SEO at the same time?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Yes \\u2014 PPC generates immediate leads while SEO builds long-term organic authority. PPC data directly informs and accelerates your SEO strategy. Over time, strong organic rankings reduce reliance on paid spend.\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"@type\\": \\"Question\\",\\n      \\"name\\": \\"How do I get started with PPC management in Dubai?\\",\\n      \\"acceptedAnswer\\": {\\n        \\"@type\\": \\"Answer\\",\\n        \\"text\\": \\"Start with our free PPC audit. We\'ll review your situation, benchmark against industry performance, identify key opportunities and inefficiencies, and provide a clear roadmap with no obligation to proceed.\\"\\n      }\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\\n\\n<!-- ===== RELATED SERVICES CTA ===== -->\\n<section class=\\"related-services\\" style=\\"background:#f8f9fa;padding:32px;border-radius:8px;margin:48px 0\\">\\n<h2>Explore Our Related Digital Marketing Services<\\/h2>\\n<p>PPC delivers immediate results \\u2014 but the most profitable Dubai marketing strategies combine paid and organic channels. Explore how our services work together:<\\/p>\\n<ul style=\\"line-height:2.4\\">\\n  <li><a href=\\"\\/services\\/search-engine-optimization\\/\\"><strong>Search Engine Optimisation (SEO)<\\/strong><\\/a> \\u2014 Build long-term organic authority that reduces your reliance on paid ad spend over time.<\\/li>\\n  <li><a href=\\"\\/services\\/social-media-marketing\\/\\"><strong>Social Media Marketing<\\/strong><\\/a> \\u2014 Complement your Google Ads with Meta, Snapchat, and LinkedIn campaigns for full-funnel coverage.<\\/li>\\n  <li><a href=\\"\\/services\\/ai-search-optimization\\/\\"><strong>AI Search Optimisation<\\/strong><\\/a> \\u2014 Ensure your brand appears in AI-generated answers as search behaviour evolves beyond traditional results.<\\/li>\\n  <li><a href=\\"\\/services\\/web-design\\/\\"><strong>Web Design<\\/strong><\\/a> \\u2014 Convert your PPC traffic with landing pages designed and tested for UAE audiences.<\\/li>\\n  <li><a href=\\"\\/services\\/web-development\\/\\"><strong>Web Development<\\/strong><\\/a> \\u2014 Fast, secure technical infrastructure that maximises Quality Scores and landing page performance.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p style=\\"margin-top:24px\\"><strong>Stop wasting ad budget. Start getting results.<\\/strong> <a href=\\"\\/contact\\/\\" style=\\"background:#0057b8;color:#fff;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-top:8px\\">Get Your Free PPC Audit \\u2192<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/section>\\n<\\/div>"}}]}]},{"id":"817b3ed","elType":"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","content_width":{"unit":"px","size":1200},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"80","right":"20","bottom":"80","left":"20","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"2c6f5dd","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"content_position":"middle"},"elements":[{"id":"91066e2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"Get Your Free PPC & Google Ads Management Dubai, UAE Audit","link":{"url":"\\/contact"},"button_type":"info","align":"center","background_color":"#00b4d8","border_radius":{"unit":"px","size":6}}}]}]}]'),
