('236', '0', '2026-07-30 06:38:36', '2026-07-30 06:38:36', '<div class="container" style="max-width:820px;padding:4rem 1.5rem"><div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:3rem"><h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1><p style="color:#6b7280">Everything you need to know about SEO, digital marketing and working with us in Dubai.</p></div><div id="faq-list"><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">What is SEO and why does my UAE business need it?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>SEO (Search Engine Optimisation) is the process of improving your website so it ranks higher on Google when potential customers search for your products or services. In the UAE, 90%+ of purchase journeys begin with a Google search — if your competitors appear before you, you lose those customers.</p></div></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">How long does SEO take to show results in Dubai?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>Most UAE businesses see meaningful ranking improvements within 3–6 months. Competitive industries like real estate and legal can take 6–12 months. SEO is a long-term investment that compounds over time — unlike paid ads.</p></div></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">How much does SEO cost in Dubai?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>SEO packages in Dubai range from AED 2,500/month for small businesses to AED 15,000+/month for competitive enterprise campaigns. Our packages start at AED 3,000/month, tailored to your goals and competition level. We offer a free audit first.</p></div></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">Do you offer local SEO for Dubai and UAE cities?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>Yes — local SEO is one of our specialities. We optimise your Google Business Profile, build local citations, manage reviews and create location-specific landing pages for all UAE emirates and Dubai districts like Marina, Business Bay, Downtown and Deira.</p></div></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">Can you guarantee first-page Google rankings?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>No ethical SEO agency can guarantee specific rankings. What we guarantee is transparent monthly reporting, proven white-hat strategies and a track record of getting 90%+ of our clients to page one within 6–9 months. Our 99% client retention speaks to consistent results.</p></div></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">Do you do SEO in Arabic as well as English?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>Yes. Arabic keywords often have less competition with strong commercial intent. We conduct bilingual keyword research, create Arabic content and optimise for Arabic search patterns — an important advantage most international agencies miss.</p></div></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:.75rem;overflow:hidden"><button onclick="this.nextElementSibling.style.display=this.nextElementSibling.style.display===`block`?`none`:`block`" style="width:100%;background:#fff;border:none;padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#101A6A;cursor:pointer">What is included in a free SEO audit?</button><div style="display:none;padding:0 1.5rem 1.25rem;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7"><p>Our free 48-hour audit covers: current ranking positions, technical issues, on-page SEO gaps, backlink profile analysis, competitor comparison and a prioritised action plan. No obligation — most clients call it the most useful hour they have spent on marketing.</p></div></div></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:3rem;padding:2.5rem;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:16px"><h3 style="margin-bottom:.5rem">Still have questions?</h3><p style="color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Our team responds within 2 hours on weekdays.</p><a href="/contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#16B1D4;color:#fff;padding:.9rem 2rem;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Talk to an SEO Specialist →</a></div></div>', 'Frequently Asked Questions', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'faq', '', '', '2026-07-30 06:38:36', '2026-07-30 06:38:36', '', '0', 'http://localhost:8000/faq/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('237', '0', '2026-07-30 06:38:46', '2026-07-30 06:38:46', '<div class="container" style="max-width:820px;padding:4rem 1.5rem"><h1>Terms of Service</h1><p><em>Last updated: July 2026</em></p><h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2><p>By using services provided by SearchEngineOptimization.ae, you agree to these Terms of Service.</p><h2>2. Services</h2><p>We provide SEO, PPC management, social media marketing, web design, web development and related digital marketing services. Scope, deliverables and timelines are outlined in the individual Service Agreement.</p><h2>3. Payment Terms</h2><p>Monthly retainer fees are due on the 1st of each month. Invoices unpaid after 14 days attract a 2% monthly late fee. Services may be paused on accounts 30+ days overdue.</p><h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2><p>Content and campaigns we create remain our intellectual property until final payment, at which point ownership transfers to the Client. Our proprietary tools and processes remain ours at all times.</p><h2>5. Results Disclaimer</h2><p>We do not guarantee specific search engine rankings. Results depend on many factors including competition and algorithm changes. We commit to best-practice strategies and transparent reporting.</p><h2>6. Confidentiality</h2><p>Both parties agree to keep confidential any proprietary information shared during the engagement.</p><h2>7. Termination</h2><p>Either party may terminate monthly retainer services with 30 days written notice. Fees paid for completed work are non-refundable.</p><h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>Our liability is limited to fees paid for the month in which the issue arose. We are not liable for indirect or consequential damages.</p><h2>9. Governing Law</h2><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates. Disputes are subject to the courts of Dubai, UAE.</p><h2>10. Contact</h2><p>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@searchengineoptimization.ae">legal@searchengineoptimization.ae</a> | M-01 Muteena Street, Deira, Dubai, UAE.</p></div>', 'Terms of Service', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'terms-of-service', '', '', '2026-07-30 06:38:46', '2026-07-30 06:38:46', '', '0', 'http://localhost:8000/terms-of-service/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
